$ kluris doctor --help
== stdout (732 bytes)
Check prerequisites and refresh installed agent skills.

Checks that git runs, that the first kluris on PATH is this one, and that the config and every registered brain's kluris.yml read. Then refreshes the companion playbooks and re-installs every brain's agent skill (~/.agents/skills, plus the folders of the selected agents), removing the copies Kluris 2 left in folders it no longer uses. This is the step after an upgrade: run `kluris doctor` and everything is back in sync.

Pass --no-refresh to run only the read-only checks.

Usage: kluris doctor [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --no-refresh
          Skip refreshing installed agent skills

      --json
          JSON output

      --help
          Show this message and exit.
== stderr (0 bytes)
== exit 0
